      "comment" : "A key name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Help"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold %@ to talk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住%@说话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a key, speak, and let go. Orra types what you said into the app you are using. Your voice is turned into text on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住一个键，说话，然后松开。Orra 会把你说的话输入到你正在使用的 App 中。语音在这台 Mac 上转成文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the talk key on its own, speak, and let go. A left Control, Option or Command key starts recording only after you hold it alone for a moment, so its shortcuts keep working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单独按住说话键，说话，然后松开。左侧 Control、Option 或 Command 键要单独按住片刻才开始录音，所以它们的快捷键照常可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home" : {
      "comment" : "A key name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Orra %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装 Orra %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds Orra’s version, settings, permissions and log from the last hour, facts about your Mac and recent crash reports. It holds no dictated text and no audio. Your name and your Mac’s name are taken out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中有 Orra 的版本、设置、权限和最近一小时的日志，你的 Mac 的信息，以及最近的崩溃报告。其中没有听写的文字，也没有录音。你的名字和 Mac 的名称会被去掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语言"
