      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version, speech model, updates and privacy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本、语音模型、更新和隐私。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vocabulary" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人词库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vocabulary is full, so “%@” was not added" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人词库已满，没有加入“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Orra" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎使用 Orra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happened?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发生了什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you did, what you expected, and what happened instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你做了什么，预期的结果是什么，实际发生了什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is on, Orra reads the text of the field you dictated into for up to 3 minutes after each paste, while you are in that field, never a password field. When you fix a misheard word, Orra adds the right spelling to your vocabulary and shows a notice where you can undo it. Orra keeps only the word pairs, on this Mac. It works in apps that let macOS read their text, such as Notes, Mail and Safari, but not in some editors and terminals. There, copy the right word and add it from the Orra menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后，每次粘贴后的 3 分钟内，只要你还在那个输入框里，Orra 就会读取它的文字，从不读取密码框。你改正一个听错的词，Orra 就会把正确的写法加入个人词库，并弹出提示，你可以撤销。Orra 只保存词对，只存在这台 Mac 上。它只在 macOS 能读取文字的 App 里生效，比如备忘录、邮件和 Safari，部分编辑器和终端不行。在这些 App 里，请拷贝正确的词，再从 Orra 菜单里添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which microphone Orra records from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 用哪个麦克风录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this microphone is not connected, Orra uses the system default. With the lid closed, a MacBook's own microphone is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个麦克风未连接时，Orra 使用系统默认输入。合上盖子时，MacBook 自带的麦克风会关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you dictate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听写时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows key" : {
      "comment" : "The key a keyboard with a Windows layout has in place of Command",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "词语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words and names that Orra should write your way, and learning from your corrections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Orra 按你的写法输出的词和名字，以及从你的修改中学习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write numbers as digits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把数字写成阿拉伯数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this later in Settings, General." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后也可以在“设置”的“通用”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your language, the talk key, what you see and hear while dictating, and how Orra starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "界面语言、说话键、听写时的提示，以及 Orra 如何启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your text was too long for the link, so GitHub shows only its start. The full text is on your clipboard. On GitHub, select all the text in the What happened box and paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的内容太长，链接放不下，所以 GitHub 只显示开头部分。完整内容已放到剪贴板上。请在 GitHub 上全选“发生了什么”框里的文字，再粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.3"
